  "dct_title_s": "Channel Steepness, Concavity 0.4, Central America",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This raster dataset is a georeferenced image showing channel steepness calculated performed using a variable length horizontal window designed to achieve a particular elevation drop along a profile. Channel steepness calculated using an assumed concavity of 0.4",
    "This is a derivative datasset from the 15\" HydroSHEDs data products, which calculates channel steepness according to the methodology described in the paper."
